orts AP Mode and Repeater Mode with easy 1-Tap setup\\nFeatures Ethernet port for stable speed and Alexa compatibility\\nIncludes WEP and WPA/WPA2 security protocols for network protection\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nThis WiFi extender utilizes advanced central processing and new-generation chips to extend wireless signals to hard-to-reach areas. It features a practical plug-wall design for plug-and-play installation, ideal for home or travel use.\\nFunction \\u0026 Performance\\nThe device supports dual band technology, providing up to 300Mbps for 2.4GHz and 360-degree high-speed connections. It connects up to 45 devices, including smartphones, laptops, tablets, speakers, IP cameras, and more.\\nInstallation \\u0026 Setup\\nUsers can press the WPS button to expand wireless range or use browser-based configuration accessible on iOS and Android. AP Mode covers a wired network to a wireless network, while Repeater Mode extends an existing wireless network.\\nUsage/Scenarios\\nCompatible with iOS, Android, Samsung, Echo, Alexa, PC, PlayStation, smart plugs, and other standard routers or gateways. An Ethernet cable can be used to ensure stable speed without dropping.\\nCare Instructions\\nThe device supports WEP and WPA/WPA2 wireless security protocols to prevent network theft and protect important data.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"walmart-19453908483\",\"product_id\":120000112927703,\"cspu_id\":\"100000001821795\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/GJX-WiFi-Extender-WiFi-Extenders-Signal-Booster-Home-5000-sq-ft-50-Devices-WiFi-Range-Extender-Wireless-Repeater-Long-Range-Amplifier-Ethernet-Port-1/19453908483\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":1087000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"woting LTD\",\"supplier_rating\":2.3333333333333335,\"is_cheapest\":true,\"website\":\"walmart\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-824ij-mput674daadqbc\",\"video_urls\":