ication/json; charset=utf-8","t":"{\"code\":0,\"message\":\"success\",\"results\":{\"id\":\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\",\"biz_id\":1,\"messages\":[{\"id\":\"1436419432325742\",\"sender_id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"conversation_id\":\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\",\"msg_type\":8,\"timestamp\":1792579369000,\"seq\":1166,\"customized_data\":\"{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"payload\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\"Choose toner by **exact printer compatibility first**—not merely by brand or appearance.\\\\n\\\\n1. **Find the printer’s full model number**  \\\\n   Check the front label, settings page, or existing cartridge. Printers in the same series may use different toner codes.\\\\n\\\\n2. **Match the exact cartridge code**  \\\\n   Confirm the code on the printer maker’s compatibility list or packaging. A cartridge that physically fits may still be rejected by its chip.\\\\n\\\\n3. **Choose standard or high yield**\\\\n   - **Standard yield:** lower upfront cost; suitable for occasional printing.\\\\n   - **High-yield/XL:** costs more initially but usually lowers cost per page; better for frequent printing.  \\\\n   Verify that your exact printer accepts the high-yield version.\\\\n\\\\n4. **Compare cost per page**  \\\\n   Use: **cartridge price ÷ stated page yield**. Page-yield figures are standardized estimates, so heavy graphics and dense pages consume toner faster.\\\\n\\\\n5. **Decide between OEM and compatible toner**\\\\n   - **OEM:** generally the safest choice for print consistency, firmware compatibility, and support.\\\\n   - **Third-party compatible:** often less expensive, but chip recognition, leakage, colour accuracy, and actual yield can vary. Look for a clear warranty and return policy.\\\\n\\\\n6. **Check whether the drum is separate**  \\\\n   Some printers combine toner and drum in one cartridge; others require periodic drum replacement. Don’t accidentally buy only a drum unit when you need toner.\\\\n\\\\n7. **For colour printers, verify the colour and pack contents**  \\\\n   Confirm whether the listing is one black cartridge, one colour, or a complete CMYK set. Avoid listings whose displayed price applies only to one colour.\\\\n\\\\n8. **Check regional and firmware restrictions**  \\\\n   Some cartridges are region-specific, and printer firmware updates can affect third-party chips. Confirm the cartridge’s region and supported firmware before ordering.\\\\n\\\\n**Best default:** occasional home use → standard-yield OEM; frequent office printing → compatible high-yield OEM, or a well-warranted third-party cartridge if reducing cost per page matters most.\\\\n\\\\nIf you share the printer’s exact model number and country, I can identify the correct cartridge code.\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},\\\"header\\\":{},\\\"extra_info\\\":{\\\"billing_user_id\\\":\\\"1312453424980595\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"shopping_guide\\\",\\\"cost_state\\\":2,\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"STOP\\\",\\\"follow_up_query_suggestions\\\":[\\\"How to find my printer model?\\\"]}}]}\"}],\"last_update_timestamp\":1792579369000,\"type\":2,\"conversation_info\":{\"individual_chat_info\":{\"self_user\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980595\",\"email\":\"yunzhao.wang@shopee.com\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKSTbh9Bga7HApyQcD8DUbuaYi9MMiPzTk5Rvyw2AhNhKwaoM=s96-c\",\"user_type\":1,\"twin_id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"status\":1,\"twin\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang's Migoo\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://migoo.ai/beeai/api/v1/media/download/2025/12/15/e9e12f4d.png\",\"user_type\":2}},\"other_user\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang's Migoo\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://migoo.ai/beeai/api/v1/media/download/2025/12/15/e9e12f4d.png\",\"user_type\":2,\"attribute\":{\"twin_can_mention\":true}}}},\"attribute\":{\"conversation_id\":\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\",\"is_pinned\":false,\"mute_notification\":